  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large cast-iron pot over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the char-grilled beef and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the diced red bell pepper and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chili powder and cumin powder, and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, until the mixture thickens.",
    "Add the black beans, diced tomatoes, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 20-25 minutes, or until the flavors have melded together.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro, if desired."
